Version 1.1 - 2026-10-??
  * Added Enabled option (displays "X" and stops requests when disabled).
  * Added response ordering and timeout to prevent stale updates.
  * Added SPDX headers to main.qml, config.qml, main.xml.
  * Blink Refresh enabled by default.
  * Fixed daily price change of 0% showing as error.
  * Fixed invalid multiplier (empty, dot) displaying NaN.
  * Fixed thousands separator breaking decimal places.
  * Fixed ticker field accepting BRK.B and similar.
  * Ignoring price multiplier when displaying daily price change percentage.
  * Removed code: priceFlash, errorColor, inErrorState check, ConfigComboBox.
  * Removed duplicate default values from QML (use main.xml only).
  * Removed duplicate refresh timers and debounce ticker/API key changes.
  * Standardize imports (remove versions), fix variable names, remove tabs.
  * Updated README with Ticker Value option and fix Blink Refresh description.

Version 1.0 - 2025-05-08
  * Initial version.
